Nethermind.Crypto.BlsNet

This project is a C# rewrite of blst by Supranational, adapting its
algorithms, formulas and constants for managed .NET.
https://github.com/supranational/blst, commit
f62244ef50ad1a603decdb8f215e982d2a467bb6.

