The rewrite changes the implementation language, runtime, APIs and
optimizations. Upstream copyright and source attribution notices are
retained in the adapted files.

The optional patches jit/followup.patch and jit/inverse-selects.patch
modify dotnet/runtime, https://github.com/dotnet/runtime.
